msgctxt "Description|"
msgid "BFpack"
msgstr "BFpack"

msgctxt "Description|"
msgid ""
"A module for computing Bayes factors for equality, inequality, and order "
"constrained hypotheses."
msgstr ""
"等式制約、不等式制約、順序制約のある仮説のベイズファクターを計算する"
"モジュールです。"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid ""
"Assign dependent variables, fixed factors, and optional covariates for the "
"(M)AN(C)OVA model."
msgstr "(M)AN(C)OVAモデルに従属変数、固定要因、必要に応じて共変量を割り当てます。"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid ""
"Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr "分析に割り当てられる、データセット内の変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid "Dependent Variables"
msgstr "従属変数"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid ""
"One or more continuous outcome variables. One dependent variable yields an "
"AN(C)OVA; multiple dependent variables yield a MAN(C)OVA."
msgstr ""
"1つ以上の連続な結果変数です。従属変数が1つならAN(C)OVA、複数ならMAN(C)OVAにな"
"ります。"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid "Fixed Factors"
msgstr "固定要因"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid ""
"Categorical grouping variables whose mean differences and interactions are "
"tested in the model."
msgstr "平均の差と交互作用をモデルで検定する、カテゴリカルなグループ化変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "共変量"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid ""
"Continuous predictors to adjust for in the analysis. Adding covariates turns "
"the model into an ANCOVA or MANCOVA."
msgstr ""
"分析で調整する連続な予測変数です。共変量を加えるとモデルはANCOVAまたはMANCOVA"
"になります。"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid "μ"
msgstr "μ"

msgctxt "bfpackAnova|"
msgid "each adjusted mean or regression effect in the AN(C)OVA model"
msgstr "AN(C)OVAモデルの調整済み平均または回帰効果のそれぞれ"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid ""
"Assign the variables whose correlations will be tested, plus optional "
"grouping and covariate variables."
msgstr "相関を検定する変数と、必要に応じてグループ化変数と共変量を割り当てます。"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid ""
"Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr "分析に割り当てられる、データセット内の変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "変数"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid ""
"Select at least two variables whose correlations will be estimated and "
"tested. Supported associations include product-moment, polychoric, "
"tetrachoric, polyserial, and biserial correlations."
msgstr ""
"相関を推定・検定する変数を2つ以上選びます。積率相関、ポリコリック相関、"
"テトラコリック相関、ポリシリアル相関、バイシリアル相関に対応しています。"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "Grouping Variable"
msgstr "グループ化変数"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid ""
"Optional nominal grouping variable for testing independent correlations "
"across groups."
msgstr ""
"グループごとに独立した相関を検定するための、名義尺度のグループ化変数です。任"
"意です。"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "Covariates"
msgstr "共変量"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "Optional covariates to control for when estimating the correlations."
msgstr "相関を推定するときに統制する共変量です。任意です。"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "ρ"
msgstr "ρ"

msgctxt "bfpackCorrelation|"
msgid "each correlation coefficient"
msgstr "相関係数のそれぞれ"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid ""
"Assign continuous dependent variables and predictor variables for the linear "
"regression model."
msgstr "線形回帰モデルに連続な従属変数と予測変数を割り当てます。"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid ""
"Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr "分析に割り当てられる、データセット内の変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid "Dependent Variables"
msgstr "従属変数"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid ""
"One or more continuous outcome variables. Multiple dependent variables fit a "
"multivariate multiple regression."
msgstr ""
"1つ以上の連続な結果変数です。従属変数が複数の場合は多変量重回帰を当てはめます"
"。"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid "Predictor Variables"
msgstr "予測変数"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid ""
"Predictor variables for the regression model. Nominal and ordinal predictors "
"are dummy coded automatically when needed."
msgstr ""
"回帰モデルの予測変数です。名義尺度と順序尺度の予測変数は、必要に応じて自動で"
"ダミーコード化されます。"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid "β"
msgstr "β"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLinear|"
msgid "each regression coefficient"
msgstr "回帰係数のそれぞれ"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid ""
"Assign an ordinal or nominal dependent variable and predictor variables for "
"the logistic regression model."
msgstr ""
"ロジスティック回帰モデルに順序尺度または名義尺度の従属変数と予測変数を割り当"
"てます。"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid ""
"Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr "分析に割り当てられる、データセット内の変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid "Dependent Variable"
msgstr "従属変数"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid ""
"Outcome variable for the logistic model. Ordinal outcomes fit an ordered "
"logistic regression; binary nominal outcomes fit a binary logistic "
"regression."
msgstr ""
"ロジスティックモデルの結果変数です。順序尺度なら順序ロジスティック回帰、2値の"
"名義尺度なら2項ロジスティック回帰を当てはめます。"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid "Predictor Variables"
msgstr "予測変数"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid "Predictor variables for the logistic regression model."
msgstr "ロジスティック回帰モデルの予測変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid "β"
msgstr "β"

msgctxt "bfpackRegressionLogistic|"
msgid "each logistic regression coefficient"
msgstr "ロジスティック回帰係数のそれぞれ"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid ""
"Assign one continuous outcome variable and one nominal grouping variable for "
"the independent samples t-test."
msgstr ""
"独立標本のt検定に、連続な結果変数を1つと名義尺度のグループ化変数を1つ割り当て"
"ます。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid ""
"Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr "分析に割り当てられる、データセット内の変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "変数"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "Continuous outcome variable to compare between the two groups."
msgstr "2つのグループ間で比較する連続な結果変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "Grouping Variable"
msgstr "グループ化変数"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "Nominal variable defining the two independent groups."
msgstr "2つの独立したグループを定める名義尺度の変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "difference"
msgstr "差"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestIndependentSamples|"
msgid "the group mean difference"
msgstr "グループ平均の差"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid ""
"Assign the continuous variables whose means will be tested jointly in the "
"multivariate t-test."
msgstr "多変量t検定で平均を同時に検定する連続変数を割り当てます。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid ""
"Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr "分析に割り当てられる、データセット内の変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "Variables"
msgstr "変数"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "Continuous variables whose means are tested simultaneously."
msgstr "平均を同時に検定する連続変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "μ"
msgstr "μ"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "the means of the selected variables"
msgstr "選択した変数の平均"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "Specify test value"
msgstr "検定値を指定"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid ""
"Set the reference mean for each selected variable in the standard hypothesis "
"test."
msgstr "標準的な仮説検定で、選択した各変数の基準となる平均を設定します。"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "bfpackTTestMultiSample|"
msgid "Test value for the mean of %1."
msgstr "%1 の平均に対する検定値です。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid "Assign one continuous variable for the one-sample t-test."
msgstr "1標本t検定に連続変数を1つ割り当てます。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid ""
"Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr "分析に割り当てられる、データセット内の変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "変数"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid "Continuous variable whose mean will be tested."
msgstr "平均を検定する連続変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid "mu"
msgstr "mu"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestOneSample|"
msgid "the population mean"
msgstr "母平均"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid "Assign the two continuous variables that form the paired comparison."
msgstr "対応のある比較を構成する2つの連続変数を割り当てます。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid ""
"Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr "分析に割り当てられる、データセット内の変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid "Pair"
msgstr "ペア"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid "Pair the two continuous variables whose mean difference will be tested."
msgstr "平均の差を検定する2つの連続変数をペアにします。"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid "difference"
msgstr "差"

msgctxt "bfpackTTestPairedSamples|"
msgid "the mean difference between the paired variables"
msgstr "ペアにした変数間の平均の差"

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid ""
"Assign one outcome variable and one grouping variable for the variance "
"comparison."
msgstr "分散の比較に、結果変数を1つとグループ化変数を1つ割り当てます。"

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid ""
"Available variables from the data set that can be assigned to the analysis."
msgstr "分析に割り当てられる、データセット内の変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "変数"

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid "Outcome variable whose group variances will be compared."
msgstr "グループ間で分散を比較する結果変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid "Grouping Variable"
msgstr "グループ化変数"

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid "Nominal variable defining the groups whose variances are compared."
msgstr "分散を比較するグループを定める名義尺度の変数です。"

msgctxt "bfpackVariances|"
msgid "the group variances"
msgstr "グループの分散"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid ""
"Specify confirmatory hypotheses with equality (=) and order (<, >) "
"constraints on the available parameters. Separate multiple hypotheses into "
"rows and optionally include a complement hypothesis."
msgstr ""
"利用できる母数に等式制約 (=) と順序制約 (<, >) を置いて、確認的な仮説を指定し"
"ます。複数の仮説は行を分けて記述し、必要に応じて補仮説を含めます。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "<b>Manual Hypothesis Test</b>"
msgstr "<b>手動での仮説検定</b>"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Click for more information"
msgstr "詳しくはクリックしてください"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid ""
"List of manually specified hypotheses. Use parameter names from the "
"Parameters box, assign prior weights, and tick Include for the hypotheses "
"that should be tested."
msgstr ""
"手動で指定した仮説の一覧です。母数ボックスにある母数名を使い、事前分布重みを"
"割り当て、検定したい仮説の「含める」にチェックを入れます。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Hypotheses"
msgstr "仮説"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Prior weight"
msgstr "事前分布重み"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Include"
msgstr "含める"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "H%1:"
msgstr "H%1:"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid ""
"Enter a constrained hypothesis using the shown parameter names, for example "
"a = 0, a > 0, or a > b > 0."
msgstr ""
"表示されている母数名を使って制約付き仮説を入力します。例: a = 0、a > 0、a > "
"b > 0。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Prior weight for this manual hypothesis."
msgstr "この手動仮説の事前分布重みです。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Include this manual hypothesis in the analysis."
msgstr "この手動仮説を分析に含めます。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Complement hypothesis"
msgstr "補仮説"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Prior weight assigned to the complement hypothesis."
msgstr "補仮説に割り当てる事前分布重みです。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowManual|"
msgid "Include the complement hypothesis in the hypothesis set."
msgstr "補仮説を仮説の集合に含めます。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "mu"
msgstr "mu"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "the means of the selected variables relative to their test values"
msgstr "検定値に対する、選択した変数の平均"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "the group variances"
msgstr "グループの分散"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "ρ"
msgstr "ρ"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "the correlation coefficients"
msgstr "相関係数"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "the parameter %1"
msgstr "母数 %1"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "<b>Standard Hypothesis Test</b>"
msgstr "<b>標準的な仮説検定</b>"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid ""
"Tests whether each selected mean equals its test value or differs from it."
msgstr "選択した各平均が検定値と等しいか、異なるかを検定します。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Tests whether the group variances are equal or unequal."
msgstr "グループの分散が等しいか、等しくないかを検定します。"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid ""
"Tests whether %1 is equal to, smaller than, or larger than the specified "
"test value."
msgstr "%1 が指定した検定値と等しいか、小さいか、大きいかを検定します。"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Tests whether %1 is equal to, smaller than, or larger than zero."
msgstr "%1 がゼロと等しいか、小さいか、大きいかを検定します。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H0: "
msgstr "H0: "

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H±: "
msgstr "H±: "

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H0: Equal variances"
msgstr "H0: 等分散"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H±: Unequal variances"
msgstr "H±: 不等分散"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H-: "
msgstr "H-: "

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "H+: "
msgstr "H+: "

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Hypotheses"
msgstr "仮説"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Test value"
msgstr "検定値"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Prior weights"
msgstr "事前分布重み"

#, qt-format
msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Reference value used in the standard hypothesis test for %1."
msgstr "%1 の標準的な仮説検定で用いる基準値です。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid ""
"Prior weight for the first standard hypothesis. Larger values assign more "
"prior probability to that hypothesis."
msgstr ""
"1つ目の標準仮説の事前分布重みです。値を大きくすると、その仮説により大きな事前"
"確率を割り当てます。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Prior weight for the second standard hypothesis."
msgstr "2つ目の標準仮説の事前分布重みです。"

msgctxt "HypothesesWindowStandard|"
msgid "Prior weight for the third standard hypothesis."
msgstr "3つ目の標準仮説の事前分布重みです。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Options"
msgstr "オプション"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Configure Bayes factor reporting, tables, plots, uncertainty intervals, "
"sampling settings, and model-specific options."
msgstr ""
"ベイズファクターの報告、表、プロット、不確実性区間、サンプリングの設定、"
"モデル固有のオプションを設定します。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Bayes Factor"
msgstr "ベイズファクター"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Log scale"
msgstr "対数スケール"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Report Bayes factors on the natural logarithm scale."
msgstr "ベイズファクターを自然対数のスケールで報告します。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Bayes factor type"
msgstr "ベイズファクターの種類"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Choose how the default fractional Bayes factor prior is centered for "
"hypothesis testing."
msgstr ""
"既定の部分ベイズファクターの事前分布を、仮説検定でどこに中心化するかを選びま"
"す。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Fractional Bayes factor"
msgstr "部分ベイズファクター"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Uses the default fractional Bayes factor, with the fractional prior centered "
"at the maximum likelihood estimate."
msgstr "既定の部分ベイズファクターを使い、部分事前分布を最尤推定値に中心化します。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Adjusted fractional Bayes factor"
msgstr "調整済み部分ベイズファクター"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Uses the adjusted fractional Bayes factor, with the fractional prior "
"centered at a null value."
msgstr "調整済み部分ベイズファクターを使い、部分事前分布を帰無値に中心化します。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Tables"
msgstr "表"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Select which result tables should be included in the output."
msgstr "出力に含める結果の表を選びます。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Standard hypotheses: View BFs"
msgstr "標準仮説: ベイズファクターを表示"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Show the Bayes factor table for the standard hypothesis test."
msgstr "標準的な仮説検定のベイズファクターの表を表示します。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Manual hypotheses: Computation BFs"
msgstr "手動仮説: ベイズファクターの計算"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Show the table with fit, complexity, and Bayes factor components for the "
"manual hypotheses."
msgstr "手動仮説の適合、複雑さ、ベイズファクターの構成要素を含む表を表示します。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Estimates"
msgstr "推定値"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Show the parameter estimates table with uncertainty intervals."
msgstr "不確実性区間つきの母数推定値の表を表示します。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Plots"
msgstr "プロット"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Select which plots should be included in the output."
msgstr "出力に含めるプロットを選びます。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Manual hypotheses plots"
msgstr "手動仮説のプロット"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Plot the prior and posterior probabilities of the manual hypotheses."
msgstr "手動仮説の事前確率と事後確率をプロットします。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior and posterior plot"
msgstr "事前分布と事後分布プロット"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Plot the prior and posterior distributions of the sampled correlations."
msgstr "サンプリングされた相関の事前分布と事後分布をプロットします。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Estimation info"
msgstr "推定情報"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Add estimation summaries to the prior and posterior correlation plot."
msgstr "事前分布と事後分布の相関プロットに推定の要約を加えます。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Testing info"
msgstr "検定情報"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Add testing summaries for the constrained correlation hypotheses to the plot."
msgstr "制約付き相関仮説の検定の要約をプロットに加えます。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Traceplot"
msgstr "トレースプロット"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Plot the MCMC sampling traces for the correlations."
msgstr "相関のMCMCサンプリングのトレースをプロットします。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Additional Options"
msgstr "追加オプション"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Set interval levels, standardization, sampling details, and other model-"
"specific analysis settings."
msgstr "区間の水準、標準化、サンプリングの詳細、その他のモデル固有の設定を行います。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Uncertainty interval level"
msgstr "不確実性区間の水準"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Coverage level of the reported uncertainty interval, for example 95%."
msgstr "報告する不確実性区間の被覆水準です。例えば95%です。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Standardize continuous variables"
msgstr "連続変数を標準化する"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Standardize continuous variables before fitting the model."
msgstr "モデルを当てはめる前に連続変数を標準化します。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Variances"
msgstr "分散"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Assume equal or unequal group variances in the independent samples t-test."
msgstr ""
"独立標本のt検定で、グループの分散が等しいと仮定するか、等しくないと仮定するか"
"を選びます。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Equal"
msgstr "等しい"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Assume the two groups have equal variances."
msgstr "2つのグループの分散が等しいと仮定します。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Unequal"
msgstr "等しくない"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Allow the two groups to have different variances. Bayes factors are then "
"approximated by iterative sampling."
msgstr ""
"2つのグループで分散が異なることを許します。このときベイズファクターは反復"
"サンプリングで近似されます。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "No. iterations for BF computation"
msgstr "ベイズファクター計算の反復回数"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Number of iterations used when Bayes factors are computed by sampling."
msgstr "サンプリングでベイズファクターを計算するときの反復回数です。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "No. iterations for MCMC"
msgstr "MCMCの反復回数"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Number of posterior draws used to estimate the correlation model."
msgstr "相関モデルの推定に使う事後分布からの標本数です。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Sampling Method"
msgstr "サンプリング方法"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Sampling algorithm used for posterior estimation of the correlation matrix."
msgstr "相関行列の事後推定に使うサンプリングのアルゴリズムです。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "LKJ"
msgstr "LKJ"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Use the LKJ method to sample correlation matrices."
msgstr "LKJ法で相関行列をサンプリングします。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "LD"
msgstr "LD"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Use the Liu-Daniels method to sample correlation matrices."
msgstr "Liu-Daniels法で相関行列をサンプリングします。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Nugget"
msgstr "ナゲット"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Scaling factor used with the LD sampler to keep sampled correlations away "
"from plus or minus one when needed."
msgstr ""
"LDサンプラーで、サンプリングされる相関が必要に応じて±1に近づきすぎないように"
"するためのスケーリング係数です。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Exclude intercept from the model"
msgstr "モデルから切片を除く"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Remove the intercept from the fitted model. This is often appropriate for "
"ANOVA-style parameterizations."
msgstr ""
"当てはめるモデルから切片を取り除きます。分散分析型のパラメータ化ではこれが適"
"切なことが多いです。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Fix the random number seed to make the analysis exactly reproducible."
msgstr "乱数のシードを固定して、分析を完全に再現できるようにします。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Interaction terms"
msgstr "交互作用項"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Select which candidate two-way interaction terms should be added to the "
"model."
msgstr "モデルに加える候補となる2次の交互作用項を選びます。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Include"
msgstr "含める"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Available two-way interaction terms generated from the selected predictors, "
"factors, or covariates."
msgstr "選択した予測変数、要因、共変量から生成された2次の交互作用項です。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Include this interaction term in the model."
msgstr "この交互作用項をモデルに含めます。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Effects"
msgstr "効果"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid ""
"Prior weights for the omnibus hypotheses that main and interaction effects "
"are absent or present in the ANOVA model."
msgstr ""
"分散分析モデルで主効果と交互作用効果が無い、または有るというオムニバス仮説に"
"対する事前分布重みです。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior weight"
msgstr "事前分布重み"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Main zero effect"
msgstr "主効果が無い"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior weight for the hypothesis that a main effect is absent."
msgstr "主効果が無いという仮説の事前分布重みです。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Main non-zero effect"
msgstr "主効果が有る"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior weight for the hypothesis that a main effect is present."
msgstr "主効果が有るという仮説の事前分布重みです。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Interaction zero effect"
msgstr "交互作用効果が無い"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior weight for the hypothesis that an interaction effect is absent."
msgstr "交互作用効果が無いという仮説の事前分布重みです。"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Interaction non-zero effect"
msgstr "交互作用効果が有る"

msgctxt "Options|"
msgid "Prior weight for the hypothesis that an interaction effect is present."
msgstr "交互作用効果が有るという仮説の事前分布重みです。"

msgctxt "ParametersWindow|"
msgid ""
"Shows the parameter names that are currently available for manual equality "
"and order constraints. The labels depend on the selected variables and the "
"fitted model."
msgstr ""
"手動での等式制約・順序制約に現在使える母数名を表示します。ラベルは選択した変"
"数と当てはめたモデルによって変わります。"

msgctxt "ParametersWindow|"
msgid "<b>Parameters:</b>"
msgstr "<b>母数:</b>"

msgctxt "ParametersWindow|"
msgid ""
"The parameters that can be tested in the manual hypothesis test appear here "
"after you assign variables to the analysis."
msgstr "手動での仮説検定で検定できる母数は、分析に変数を割り当てると表示されます。"
